{"id":"en_tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past","title":"Tears of Regret, Clouds of the Past","titleEn":"Tears of Regret, Clouds of the Past","description":"Amelia Porter fails to recognize the commitment Victor Bennetts has shown her, a mistake she comes to regret once Kenneth Doyle's treachery becomes clear. Centered on Amelia, Victor and Kenneth, the narrative unfolds against backdrops of racing and hospitals, where life-and-death struggles shape the characters' choices. Misunderstandings and hardships test their bonds as deceit, vengeance and redemption weave through their shifting relationships, pushing Amelia toward a fresh understanding of herself. Those who want to follow this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtaza/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_tears-of-regret-clouds-of-the-past_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources"